/E (We invite research scholars, industry practitioners and academicians to submit original research papers, case studies, and conceptual work aligned with the main conference theme. Submissions are encouraged across all management disciplines, with a focus on innovation, digital transformation, sustainability, and their role in shaping a future-ready India.)
